    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Outreach and Policy Unit of the Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery, AKU-SONAM, has initiated a  Policy Dialogue  series to shed light on various policy areas that impact nurses and midwives. The sessions are organised every quarter to create awareness among nurses and midwives about the most pertinent policy-level matters, equipping them with the tools required to advocate for the necessary policy-level changes and broadening their scope of practice within the existing framework.",
